     "en": [
      "challenge your own biases"
     ],
     "texte": "write a [[23-item]] to-do list"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "your brain loves evidence that proves what you",
      "already believe"
     ],
     "texte": "all due before noon, obviously. gym, emails, taxes, call grandma"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "actively look for the",
      "strongest argument",
      "against your opinion"
     ],
     "texte": "at 11:58 you've ticked off exactly one: [[write the list]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "getting smarter",
      "means getting better",
      "at noticing when your",
      "own thinking is wrong"
     ],
     "texte": "then feel guilty all afternoon and rewrite it tonight, [[even longer]]. see you tomorrow!!"
    }
